  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you create a trinket, they last 8 hours, plus an additional hour for every point your check exceeds the Craft DC before it returns to its base components. This does not benefit trinkets created in 1 round or shorter, or those created with Cobbled Creation.</p>\n<p>Additionally, while you maintain the cobbled creation approach, you can create a trinket as a standard action instead of a full-round action. For every 10 ranks you possess in the associated skill, this action cost is reduced by one step (standard to move, move to swift).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/artifice#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
